WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:04.387
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.388 --> 00:00:08.208
What do they see?

3
00:00:08.209 --> 00:00:15.238
They see a farm.

4
00:00:15.239 --> 00:00:23.588
The blobs go into a field.

5
00:00:23.589 --> 00:01:09.340
They pick orange carrots.

6
00:01:09.341 --> 00:01:30.916
They pick green cucumbers.

7
00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:58.185
They pick purple eggplants.

8
00:01:58.186 --> 00:02:24.552
They pick yellow corn.

9
00:02:24.553 --> 00:02:36.707
They pick white onions.

10
00:02:36.708 --> 00:02:42.962
They pick red chili peppers.

11
00:02:42.963 --> 00:02:44.603
Blobs, wait!

12
00:02:44.604 --> 00:02:58.900
Those are very spicy!

13
00:02:58.901 --> 00:03:02.145
Silly blobs!

14
00:03:02.146 --> 00:03:04.929
Good-bye!

